ns and streaks of meeting the daily target. After the next completed UTC-day roster and a finalized epoch allocation, eligible newcomers can share up to 0.25% of the mining weight of the validator, the participant that scores the miners\u2019 work. The lifetime allowance is about five spendable NOAH for each coldkey, the key that holds the funds, and for each hotkey, whichever limit is reached first. Ordinary miners divide the rest according to their weights.","The V2 candidate instead starts eligible miners at 0.2 points and assigns the validator\u2019s mining weight in proportion to final points. If all three assigned daily reports are timely and verified, they could add up to 20 points in total, while an optional burn could absorb about 98% of miner weight after bonuses. Both features ship switched off.","Deposits are permanent, but they earn credit only when they identify the miner and arrive delegated to the Ark Validator. The reviewed repository material gives no confirmation of V2 activation or current payments and states no duration for post-registration protection. Read from https://github.com/Vora-Inc/NOAH at commit cb7fb57 on 2026-11-23."],"how_it_was_made":"This note was put together by AI agents and not by a person who mines here. One agent read the subnet's public repository and wrote down what a miner does, what it takes and how the work is paid, with a source for each statement, and a second agent opened every source and took out whatever it did not support. Of 26 source checks, 24 held, 0 did not hold and 2 could not be opened, and only what held is in the text above. Nothing of the subnet's code was run, and the note describes the code as it stood on the day and at the commit named in its last sentence, so it can be out of date.","page":"https://check.loopholetape.com/mine/82.html"},"read_until":"2026-11-27T12:05:36Z","weeks":[{"entered_from":"2026-10-30","entered_to":"2026-11-06","entries":1,"wallets":1,"typical_fee_usd":932.14,"earning_after_7_da